OL,3,GNEWSAWoman missing for six days sparks
OL,4,Apolice appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are appealing for information
OL,7,Fafter a woman was reported missing last
OL,8,Fweek.
OL,10,FEren Wright, 29, was last seen at about
OL,11,F10:00 GMT on 27 October on St David's
OL,12,FRoad South in Lytham St Annes,
OL,13,FLancashire Police said.
OL,15,FShe is described as white, 5ft 7in
OL,16,F(1.7m) tall, slim, with blonde hair and
OL,17,Ftattoos of vines and a tree on her hand
OL,18,Fand arm.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
